version: "1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-10-15

doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21310278
url: "https://github.com/heslab-uper/gsmap-explorer"

abstract: >
  GSMaP Explorer is a Python-based software for processing hourly GSMaP
  NetCDF rainfall data over Indonesia. It subsets the 0.1-degree grid by a
  bounding box or by the extent of a watershed shapefile, converts time
  from UTC to Indonesian local time (WIB, WITA, WIT) labelled at the end
  of each hourly period, exports gridded
  hourly rainfall and grid-point coordinates to CSV, and renders hourly
  rainfall maps. For each sub-watershed it builds Thiessen polygons from
  the grid points and computes area-weighted areal rainfall, exported as
  hourly, daily and monthly series and as annual maximum daily rainfall.

keywords:
  - GSMaP
  - rainfall
  - hydrology
  - watershed
  - sub-watershed
  - NetCDF
  - Indonesia

